# direnv → devenv auto-activation (self-contained; no global direnv config).
#
# The loader is emitted by the Nix-pinned devenv binary, so it is
# content-addressed by devenv's /nix/store path and version-matched to it —
# offline, nothing fetched at runtime. The environment itself is pinned by
# devenv.lock. Run `direnv allow` once.
#
# Reaches: the VS Code integrated terminal via the zsh hook, and the editor
# internals (clangd / tasks / debugger) via the mkhl.direnv extension.
eval "$(devenv direnvrc)"

use devenv
